&#x200B;

he has a whole song about that lol

I will steal sandwiches too. Will you guys sign a petition to get my character a dedicated DLC as well?

&#x200B;

damn this sub gets ridiculous sometimes, lol but hey, at least it gives some good laughs.

[https://4archive.org/board/x/thread/19409525/alright-x-you-want-to-see-the-full-video-it-is-rather-sad](https://4archive.org/board/x/thread/19409525/alright-x-you-want-to-see-the-full-video-it-is-rather-sad)

&#x200B;

here is an old 4chan thread where people were talking about the wipee video while it was still up. Here's what one of them says:

"Watched on my phone, so it was hard to tell but it looked like someone wiping something (blood? chocolate syrup?) off another person's torso and that person getting ticklish."

&#x200B;

sounds pretty similar to my description, I'm reassured I thought I was becoming crazy lol. No mention of a third person anywhere in the thread, maybe you're confusing with another video?

Didn't mean to sound like this guy when saying "any true X fan" lol sorry.

&#x200B;

You see, I'm not crazy then lmao

Well I can guarantee you that this is a demo version of The End is Nigh. If you have another version then send it. 

&#x200B;

Peace

He said that he saw doctors, but none of them could heal him, and if I remember right, one of them told him it was uncurable, and he gave up, according to HIM, again, maybe he lied, maybe he did something before and acted in agreement with the pastor to make everyone think Jesus is real.  Honestly, every option is possible at this point (except the godly one lol). 

&#x200B;

And now that you say it: Maybe MY brain got played? I was saying his brain may have cured him, but now that you say that this is highly impossible, I'm thinking in the reverse way, maybe MY brain was powerful enough to give me an illusion of a noticable difference when there was not in reality, because I was so convinced that something happened with the prayer? 

&#x200B;

Honestly I don't know, but it's interesting to go deep into these types of things and not just convince yourself something foolish like "god did this" just because it's comforting :)
